WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.708 --> 00:00:02.680
(squeaking)

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.180
(light music)

00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:15.855
- The box that I was born in wasn't

00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:18.741
big enough and growing
up well fed by these

00:00:18.741 --> 00:00:22.421
ads, mags, six-pack abs,
fat ass, flat stomach,

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:25.541
booty bumpin', belly rumblin',
jeans ripped, team quit

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:28.208
my years were at a baker's dozen

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:32.742
and as I grew from both
sides I slowly surmised

00:00:32.742 --> 00:00:36.362
that people my size with
thick necks and big thighs

00:00:36.362 --> 00:00:39.241
weren't allowed to have
good time in a world

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:41.408
succumbed to augmentation.

00:00:42.261 --> 00:00:46.081
Tummy tucks, Brazilian
butts, work it, earn it,

00:00:46.081 --> 00:00:48.841
train harder better faster stronger longer

00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:51.622
hours at the gym, more
fat to burn, more laps,

00:00:51.622 --> 00:00:55.522
more reps, more sets, not even close.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:58.605
I wish you had taken this seriously.

00:00:59.861 --> 00:01:01.694
You haven't earned it.

00:01:03.282 --> 00:01:04.865
Am I even worth it?

00:01:05.903 --> 00:01:09.203
When I woke something had
changed, and instead of rage,

00:01:09.203 --> 00:01:13.682
I found solace, an honest
free sample of tranquility,

00:01:13.682 --> 00:01:15.181
sweet and zesty.

00:01:15.181 --> 00:01:18.682
Happiness that I hadn't
tasted in many meals.

00:01:18.682 --> 00:01:21.432
And on that day I was beautiful.

00:01:22.842 --> 00:01:24.961
It felt unusual to feel suitable

00:01:24.961 --> 00:01:28.061
where I used to be reducible,
and now it's indisputable

00:01:28.061 --> 00:01:31.761
that when I look in the mirror
what I see is much clearer.

00:01:31.762 --> 00:01:33.679
Fear gone, sheer calm.

00:01:35.922 --> 00:01:40.542
Today, I take time to
rewind and remind myself

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:43.261
to find the good in body and mind.

00:01:43.261 --> 00:01:46.002
And though there are days
when you may feel lesser,

00:01:46.002 --> 00:01:47.502
it gets better.

00:01:47.502 --> 00:01:49.422
But it starts with
converting that pressure

00:01:49.422 --> 00:01:51.382
that made you feel terror into something

00:01:51.382 --> 00:01:53.241
you can sever and separate.

00:01:53.241 --> 00:01:55.541
I hope you can relate and
realize that the box only

00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:57.942
equates to what you make it to be,

00:01:57.942 --> 00:02:01.041
so before you listen to that
constant chatter and think

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:04.341
that all your dreams
are shattered, remember

00:02:04.341 --> 00:02:07.762
if you don't mind, it doesn't matter.

00:02:07.762 --> 00:02:10.262
(light music)

